WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:07.780
Good morning everyone, and welcome to the Acme launch event. It is great to have you here, and online, with us today.

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:14.768
Today we are going to talk about three things. The design, the camera, and of course, when you can get one.

00:00:15.468 --> 00:00:21.420
Let's start with design. Acme Phone X is milled from a single block of recycled aluminium.

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:28.000
It is thinner than last year's model, and it is lighter too, at just one hundred and seventy grams.

00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:33.836
Now, the camera. We built a new periscope lens with five times optical zoom.

00:00:34.536 --> 00:00:40.128
Low light photos are twice as bright, and video stabilisation finally works when you run.

00:00:40.828 --> 00:00:46.828
Battery life is up to two full days. And charging only costs you twenty minutes of your morning.

00:00:47.528 --> 00:00:51.608
I know what many of you are waiting to hear. We will get to that in just a moment.

00:00:52.308 --> 00:00:57.300
So, how much is it? Acme Phone X starts at just seven hundred and ninety nine dollars.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.328
That is seven ninety nine for the base model, with one hundred and twenty eight gigabytes of storage.

00:01:04.028 --> 00:01:07.844
Pre-orders open this Friday, and it ships on November twentieth.

00:01:08.544 --> 00:01:11.880
Thank you all for joining us. Now let's go take some photos.
